---
title: Manhattan
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, whiskey]
source: Our own
---

In a #mixing cup{}(with ice), pour @rye whiskey{2%fl_oz} and @sweet vermouth{1%fl_oz}. Add @Angostura bitters{2-3%dashes}. Stir well, and pour into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a @cocktail cherry{1}(Luxardo) and a @lemon peel{1%twist}, twisted over the cocktail to release citrus oils.

> another whiskey can be used, but rye is preferred.
